0\"></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 6px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 100%; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; border-top: 1px solid rgb(11, 34, 74); padding: 15px; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">2026年3月13日，卡尔美东北地区城市足球联赛（简称“东北超”）赞助商首批集中签约仪式在辽宁友谊宾馆顺利举行，盈科律师事务所与辽宁省体育产业集团有限公司正式签署商务合作协议，成为赛事官方指定法律服务机构。</span></p></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/5WgpTazXNgPvRjpdzIPibXibwDgp8WyKO35ZHDgY7SecfmzelHibdylUfoTV4DicdR00ngc0Iib6CPhqyeRauibVQZ7Q/640?wx_fmt=gif#imgIndex=2\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif\" data-ratio=\"0.05576923076923077\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"520\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; width: 636.375px !important; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\" width=\"100%\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"5\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/5WgpTazXNgPvRjpdzIPibXibwDgp8WyKO35ZHDgY7SecfmzelHibdylUfoTV4DicdR00ngc0Iib6CPhqyeRauibVQZ7Q/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\" _width=\"100%\" data-order=\"1\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"1\" data-fail=\"0\"></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0px; line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; width: 90%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KAOThu2SXBwzrPcUFeNP1a6TsHVzMDWfDtVfBETlLsVhleZNvagEPdRS4KSC7zUpzgKXdS5RXiaRRJSUlJEU07iasVPLS5a7jHYFWXkYj8ictk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=3\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.7490740740740741\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; width: 609.297px !important; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"6\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KAOThu2SXBwzrPcUFeNP1a6TsHVzMDWfDtVfBETlLsVhleZNvagEPdRS4KSC7zUpzgKXdS5RXiaRRJSUlJEU07iasVPLS5a7jHYFWXkYj8ictk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"3\" data-fail=\"0\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">作为一家全球化法律服务机构，盈科深耕体育法律服务领域多年，凭借专业的体育法律服务能力与丰富的行业经验，成为卡尔美东北超赛事官方指定的独家法律服务机构。为全力保障赛事顺利开展，盈科整合优质资源，组建了由专业律师构成的体育产业法律服务团队。</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">盈科沈阳股权高级合伙人、博望团队首席合伙人</span></strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-decoration-color: rgb(0,0,0);text-decoration-thickness: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">马俊龙</span></strong></span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">律师荣幸成为法律服务团队成员。</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">盈科博望团队深耕餐饮法律服务多年，在特许经营备案、企业合规等领域经验丰富，同时聚焦文旅体商融合，积极探索“餐饮+文旅+体育”深度赋能。此次合作既是专业实力的彰显，也是践行文旅体赋能理念的重要实践。同时，盈科博望团队将深化文旅体融合实践，释放产业协同活力，助力体育产业法治化建设，为区域文旅体商融合注入法治力量。</span></p></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 94%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/5WgpTazXNgPvRjpdzIPibXibwDgp8WyKO35ZHDgY7SecfmzelHibdylUfoTV4DicdR00ngc0Iib6CPhqyeRauibVQZ7Q/640?wx_fmt=gif#imgIndex=4\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder __bg_gif\" data-ratio=\"0.05576923076923077\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"520\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(17.931) / 1; width: 636px !important; height: auto !important;\" width=\"100%\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"7\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" data-order=\"2\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 30px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"padding: 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">文旅赋能，共赴新程。盈科博望团队既是餐饮合规守护者，也是区域文旅体产业融合的见证者与赋能者。2026年5月，我们将与您携手，共赏\"东北超\"联赛，以专业与初心助力区域产业高质量发展。</span></p></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 5px;border-left: 1px solid rgb(32, 5, 87);border-right: 1px solid rgb(32, 5, 87);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 5px 0px 0px;width: 100%;align-self: flex-start;border-left: 1px solid rgb(32, 5, 87);padding: 0px 10px;border-right: 1px solid rgb(32, 5, 87);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"margin: -8px 0px -4px;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">END</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72JtYiaessKMJ5odXpxPAkdqU43utpcZVg